id: pm-linear-zczw
title: "state filter is applied client-side after --limit, under-returning on large teams"
description: "The Linear importer state flag was filtered CLIENT-SIDE in syncLinearIssues AFTER fetching limit issues, and buildIssuesQuery had no state clause, so import limit 100 state In Progress fetched 100 issues then dropped non-matching ones locally, under-returning matches beyond the fetched window on large teams. Fix: add server-side state.name.eq clause plus state variable in buildIssuesQuery, threaded through FetchFilters/buildImportRequestPlan/syncLinearIssues."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-06-05T14:52:32.165Z"
updated_at: "2026-06-05T14:52:48.237Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "--state filters server-side via the GraphQL state.name.eq clause + variable; no clause when --state absent (zero regression); pure query-builder unit-tested"
body: ""
